# UI patterns (Cuadra)

Before changing UI, read:

**`.spec/UI-UX/patterns.md`** (adopted / next / rejected)  
and **`.spec/UI-UX/design-system.md`** for tokens, type, spacing.

Must follow when applicable:

- CRUD: Toolbar + `DataTable` + `SlideForm` + `ConfirmDialog`
- Loading → skeletons; empty → `EmptyState`; form errors → destructive `Alert`; success → `sileo`
- No feature-page `<h1>`; i18n for all copy; shadcn controls only
- Prefer existing `components/ui/*`; new pattern → add to `patterns.md` same PR

Do not: POS wizards, floating labels as default, nested sheets, error toasts for form validation, card nesting > 2.
